  Categories:
  - CategoryName: "Ng\u1EF1a trong v\xE1n in tranh th\u1EADp v\u1EADt"
    Questions:
    - Question: "Tranh th\u1EADp v\u1EADt th\u01B0\u1EDDng \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c d\xF9ng
        \u0111\u1EC3 l\xE0m g\xEC?"
      Answer1: "Trang tr\xED nh\xE0 c\u1EEDa ng\xE0y T\u1EBFt"
      Answer2: "C\xFAng M\u1EE5 ho\u1EB7c c\xFAng vong"
      Answer3: "L\xE0m qu\xE0 l\u01B0u ni\u1EC7m"
      Answer4: "Minh h\u1ECDa truy\u1EC7n d\xE2n gian "
      CorrectIndex: 1
    - Question: "Ng\u01B0\u1EDDi Vi\u1EC7t g\u1EEDi ng\u1EF1a cho th\u1EA7n linh
        v\xE0 B\xE0 M\u1EE5 v\u1EDBi mong mu\u1ED1n g\xEC?"
      Answer1: "Th\u1EC3 hi\u1EC7n s\u1EF1 gi\xE0u c\xF3"
      Answer2: "C\u1EA7u b\xECnh an, hanh th\xF4ng, gi\u1EA3i tr\u1EEB tai \u01B0\u01A1ng
        cho tr\u1EBB nh\u1ECF"
      Answer3: "\u0110\u1EC3 trang tr\xED b\xE0n th\u1EDD"
      Answer4: "L\xE0m \u0111\u1ED3 ch\u01A1i"
      CorrectIndex: 1
  - CategoryName: "Ng\u1EF1a trong v\xE1n in tranh th\u1EADp v\u1EADt"
    Questions:
    - Question: "Tranh th\u1EADp v\u1EADt th\u01B0\u1EDDng \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c d\xF9ng
        \u0111\u1EC3 l\xE0m g\xEC?"
      Answer1: "Trang tr\xED nh\xE0 c\u1EEDa ng\xE0y T\u1EBFt"
      Answer2: "C\xFAng M\u1EE5 ho\u1EB7c c\xFAng vong"
      Answer3: "L\xE0m qu\xE0 l\u01B0u ni\u1EC7m"
      Answer4: "Minh h\u1ECDa truy\u1EC7n d\xE2n gian "
      CorrectIndex: 1
    - Question: "Ng\u01B0\u1EDDi Vi\u1EC7t g\u1EEDi ng\u1EF1a cho th\u1EA7n linh
        v\xE0 B\xE0 M\u1EE5 v\u1EDBi mong mu\u1ED1n g\xEC?"
      Answer1: "Th\u1EC3 hi\u1EC7n s\u1EF1 gi\xE0u c\xF3"
      Answer2: "C\u1EA7u b\xECnh an, hanh th\xF4ng, gi\u1EA3i tr\u1EEB tai \u01B0\u01A1ng
        cho tr\u1EBB nh\u1ECF"
      Answer3: "\u0110\u1EC3 trang tr\xED b\xE0n th\u1EDD"
      Answer4: "L\xE0m \u0111\u1ED3 ch\u01A1i"
      CorrectIndex: 1
  - CategoryName: "V\u01B0\u1EDDn Ki\u1EBFn Tr\xFAc - Ghe ngo c\u1EE7a ng\u01B0\u1EDDi
      Khmer"
    Questions:
    - Question: "M\u1ED7i n\u0103m, chi\u1EBFc Ghe Ngo \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c h\u1EA1
        th\u1EE7y m\u1EA5y l\u1EA7n? "
      Answer1: "Kh\xF4ng \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c h\u1EA1 th\u1EE7y"
      Answer2: "1 l\u1EA7n m\u1ED7i n\u0103m "
      Answer3: "2 - 3 l\u1EA7n m\u1ED7i n\u0103m "
      Answer4: "M\u1ED7i Th\xE1ng 1 l\u1EA7n"
      CorrectIndex: 1
  - CategoryName: "To\xE0 C\xE1nh Di\u1EC1u - T\u1EA7ng 1 - R\u1EAFn th\u1EA7n Naga
      c\u1EE7a ng\u01B0\u1EDDi Myanmar"
    Questions:
    - Question: "Trong c\xE1c v\u1EDF r\u1ED1i d\xE2y, Naga th\u01B0\u1EDDng \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c
        th\u1EC3 hi\u1EC7n h\xECnh d\xE1ng nh\u01B0 th\u1EBF n\xE0o? "
      Answer1: "th\u1EC3 hi\u1EC7n v\u1EDBi h\xECnh d\xE1ng c\u1EE9ng r\u1EAFn, th\u1EC3
        hi\u1EC7n s\u1EF1 linh ho\u1EA1t v\xE0 quy\u1EC1n n\u0103ng."
      Answer2: "th\u1EC3 hi\u1EC7n v\u1EDBi h\xECnh d\xE1ng uy\u1EC3n chuy\u1EC3n,
        th\u1EC3 hi\u1EC7n s\u1EF1 vui nh\u1ED9n."
      Answer3: "th\u1EC3 hi\u1EC7n v\u1EDBi h\xECnh d\xE1ng uy\u1EC3n chuy\u1EC3n,
        th\u1EC3 hi\u1EC7n s\u1EF1 linh ho\u1EA1t v\xE0 quy\u1EC1n n\u0103ng."
      Answer4: "C\u1EA3 3 \u0111\xE1p \xE1n tr\xEAn \u0111\u1EC1u \u0111\xFAng"
      CorrectIndex: 2
  - CategoryName: "To\xE0 C\xE1nh Di\u1EC1u - T\u1EA7ng 2 - T\u01B0\u1EE3ng Krishna
      c\u01B0\u1EE1i tr\xEAn con qu\u1EF7 r\u1EAFn"
    Questions:
    - Question: "Th\u1EA7n Krishna \u0111\xE3 ch\u1EBF ng\u1EF1 \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c
        qu\u1EF7 r\u1EAFn khi n\xF3 l\xE0m \xF4 u\u1EBF d\xF2ng s\xF4ng th\xE1nh
        n\xE0o?"
      Answer1: "S\xF4ng Krishna"
      Answer2: "S\xF4ng Yamuna"
      Answer3: "S\xF4ng Nile"
      Answer4: "T\u1EA5t c\u1EA3 ph\u01B0\u01A1ng \xE1n tr\xEAn"
      CorrectIndex: 1
  - CategoryName: "To\xE0 C\xE1nh Di\u1EC1u - T\u1EA7ng 2 - T\u01B0\u1EE3ng Krishna
      c\u01B0\u1EE1i tr\xEAn con qu\u1EF7 r\u1EAFn"
    Questions:
    - Question: "Th\u1EA7n Krishna \u0111\xE3 ch\u1EBF ng\u1EF1 \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c
        qu\u1EF7 r\u1EAFn khi n\xF3 l\xE0m \xF4 u\u1EBF d\xF2ng s\xF4ng th\xE1nh
