      Answer1: "S\xF4ng Krishna"
      Answer2: "S\xF4ng Yamuna"
      Answer3: "S\xF4ng Nile"
      Answer4: "T\u1EA5t c\u1EA3 ph\u01B0\u01A1ng \xE1n tr\xEAn"
      CorrectIndex: 1
